# UI audit screenshots
.audit/

# Scratch scripts written by audit and review agents into the repo root, so that
# their imports resolve against node_modules. They are throwaway, they are named
# whatever the agent felt like (run3.mjs, probe7.mjs, kbd-audit.mjs), and a broad
# `git add -A` has already swept a batch of them into a commit once.
#
# Everything this project actually ships lives in scripts/, so ignoring
# root-level .mjs is safe — with the one real exception un-ignored below.
/*.mjs
!/next.config.mjs
.audit-md/
.audit/
